3. THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE DOWNLOADED AT RUNTIME
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Audio Fake Detector PRO downloads certain third-party software at runtime
in order to provide its functionality.

Such software is NOT included in the Audio Fake Detector PRO distribution
package. It is downloaded separately by the application from the respective
official source after the user has given consent to the download.

The downloaded software remains the property of its respective copyright
holder and is subject to any applicable license terms, copyright notices,
and other conditions established by that copyright holder.


a) FLAD (flad_cli.exe)
   - Copyright (c) Sg4Dylan
   - Downloaded at runtime from the author's official GitHub repository
   - The v0.2 release is described by the author as a "shared program"
     and the author states that there are currently no plans to open-source it
   - Official repository:
     https://github.com/Sg4Dylan/FLAD
   - Official v0.2 release:
     https://github.com/Sg4Dylan/FLAD/releases/tag/v0.2

Audio Fake Detector PRO does not claim ownership of FLAD.

No open-source license is asserted for the FLAD v0.2 release by
Audio Fake Detector PRO. Users should refer to the author's official
repository and release documentation for the terms applicable to FLAD.


